WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:04.838
It's already April.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:07.924
Usagi miraculously
got into Juban High School.

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:12.595
Mamo-chan easily
got accepted into medical school.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:18.518
And I grew up to be a great Guardian,

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:20.937
so I decided to
go back to the 30th century.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:26.151
Father, Mother,
please be there to greet me!

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.620
The sunlight is
too bright for the elderly.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.415
I feel at ease at night.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.376
We must act fast

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:48.548
to make our circus show
succeed in this town.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:51.134
Isn't that right, Zircon?

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.554
Are you listening,

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:56.389
my girls?

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.475
We know, old lady.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.397
You can count on us,
the Amazoness Quartet, the orb masters!

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:07.734
We must prevent
any obstruction of our business.

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:13.281
I won't tolerate even a single
unsightly bug entering our circus!

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.117
We need to fully seal the entrance then.

00:01:16.951 --> 00:01:20.246
The cursed stone
passed down among the Amazoness,

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:21.956
Amazon Stone!

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.126
Tama-no-Kouburi!

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:32.050
Moon Cosmic Power!

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.219
Moon Prism Power!

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:36.471
-Make Up!
-Make Up!

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.933
-What?
-What?

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:40.975
-Well…
-Well…

00:01:41.976 --> 00:01:43.061
-Gosh.
-Gosh.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.488
Why can't we transform?

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:54.989
-Oh, my.
-Oh, my.

00:01:58.993 --> 00:01:59.994
The Holy Grail…

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:09.045
Moon Crisis Make Up!

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.409
The Pretty Guardian.

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:42.287
In a Sailor Suit Guardian
of Love and Justice.

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:44.914
Super Sailor Moon!

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.085
Super Sailor Chibi Moon!

00:02:49.919 --> 00:02:52.422
In the name of the Moon,

00:02:52.463 --> 00:02:54.257
-I'll punish you!
-I'll punish you!

00:02:54.591 --> 00:02:57.760
So you're the ones
who tried to break our barrier. How dare you!

00:02:57.802 --> 00:02:59.470
-What?
-A barrier?

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:01.973
We'll finish you both.

00:03:03.641 --> 00:03:04.767
Tama-Yobai!

00:03:05.768 --> 00:03:07.937
Oh, Lemures! The embodiment of nightmares!

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:08.980
Get them good!

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:11.441
Go!

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:19.782
We need to attack.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:21.993
We need a weapon to defeat them!

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:26.664
Helios, please!

00:03:26.748 --> 00:03:29.000
Give us a weapon!

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:31.002
Twinkle Yell!

00:03:36.174 --> 00:03:37.342
What?

00:03:38.009 --> 00:03:39.219
Super Sailor Moon!

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:41.721
What?

00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:44.224
A kaleidoscope?

00:03:45.683 --> 00:03:47.727
Those crystal kaleidoscopes

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:51.231
desire a strong connection with you both.

00:03:52.523 --> 00:03:54.067
They're the Moon Kaleidoscope

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.194
and the Chibi Moon Kaleidoscope.

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:00.031
Get them, Lemures!

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:20.385
Moon Gorgeous!

00:04:20.468 --> 00:04:22.762
Meditation!

00:04:28.559 --> 00:04:29.602
What?

00:04:30.144 --> 00:04:30.979
What?

